---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SeeMoreInfo from '../components/SeeMoreInfo.astro';
const { services = "/services"} = Astro.props;


const Name = "Stellarwaves-5";
---
<Layout title={Name}>
    <SeeMoreInfo titleColum2 = "SEND A MESSAGE TO YOUR ZODIAC SIGN", titleColum3 = "Can messages be sent to my <br> sign of the zodiac?">
        <p slot="column2">
            Now you can connect with the constellation that represents your sign. Send your message to the Zodiac. Establish a bond with the stars that have accompanied you since your birth. Make your energy travel toward them. Communicate with your sign like never before. You just need to follow the instructions. 
            <a class="blink-02" href={services}>To send your Message, just click here.</a> 
            The stars that form your sign are light-years away, but that light still reaches us. Now, through our website, you can send an encoded message to the celestial region where your zodiac constellation resides.
            Each zodiac constellation is a myth suspended in the sky. Send your message to the constellation that houses the sign you choose. Make your story inscribed in the epic of the firmament. Connect with the energy of your sign. Send a message to the sky that saw you born. Now you can do it. To send your Message, you just need to click here. 
            <a class="blink-02" href={services}>To send your Message, just click here.</a>
        </p>

        <p slot="column3">
            Of course, yes. Your Sign is waiting for you. Now you can send a message to your horoscope sign, directly to the constellation it belongs to. The signs of the zodiac are not in a single constellation; rather, each sign corresponds to a distinct constellation within the celestial band called the zodiac. In that Constellation known as the Zodiac, each of the signs is found. Now they are within your reach: Aries, Taurus, Gemini, Cancer, Leo, Virgo, Libra, Scorpio, Sagittarius, Capricorn, Aquarius, Pisces. Communicate with them. Constellations are groupings of stars found in that same band of the sky. This band is the apparent path that the Sun follows throughout the year, and that is where the zodiac constellations are located. We will send a beam of light crossing through space, <b>which directs the messages toward the zodiac</b> constellations. It is not just a technological experiment: it is a cosmic ritual. Each sign becomes a beacon at which we aim our words. On this journey, that beam of light does not just transmit data: it transmits <b>your hope, your identity, and your poetry</b>. It is humanity projecting itself into the universe, as if each sign were a receiving station for our luminous voice. Perhaps no one will answer, perhaps the echo will be lost in the immensity, but the essential thing is that we leave our mark in the cosmos, written in light.
        </p>
    </SeeMoreInfo>
</Layout>
<style>
    body{
        /* background-image: url(../assets/images/background/star-bottle-4-blu.webp); */
        /* 
        
        background: center / cover no-repeat url('../assets/images/background/star-bottle-4-blu.webp');3dmodels-cygnus-astro-74ffde
        
        */
        background: center / 100% 100% no-repeat url(../assets/images/background/new/3dmodels-cygnus-astro-74ffde.webp);
    }
</style>
